# Tasks (Kaneo) web app mounted at /v2/tasks. The browser calls the Kaneo API directly (no Next proxy): Kaneo verifies
# the AirSend access_token itself. The API must be on the same site as the app so the cookie is sent, and its
# CORS_ORIGINS must include this app's origin. Defaults to http://localhost:1337 in development.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TASKS_API_URL=http://localhost:1337
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TASKS_APP_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TASKS_CLIENT_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TASKS_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
